      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 7(b), sections 8 and 9, subparagraphs 10(a)(ii), (iii), (iv), (v), (vi), (vii) and (viii), paragraph 10(b), sections 11, 14, 15, 16 and 17, and paragraphs 27(a) and 29(a), (b), (c), (d), (f), (g) and (h) have effect for the year of assessment 2017 and subsequent years of assessment."
      }
