      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the proviso, by substituting for the words “or organization” the words “, organization or fund”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (7), by inserting before the definition of “institution” the following definition: ‘ “fund” means a fund administered and augmented by an institution or organization in Malaysia for the sole purpose of carrying out the objectives for which the fund is established or held and that fund is not established or held primarily for profit;’;"
      }
    },
