        "@value": "in subsubparagraph (c), by substituting for the words “in the case of a donor who is a citizen or a permanent resident and” the word “where”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_I__cl_1",
