        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) Any person who— (a) has overpaid or erroneously paid any tax, surcharge, penalty, fee or other money; or (b) is entitled to a refund of tax under subsection 56(7) or refund of tax, penalty or surcharge under subsection 62(3), may make a claim thereof in the prescribed form.”;"
