      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsections: “(1A) A claim under subsection (1) shall be made to the Director General within six years from the time— (a) such overpayment or erroneous payment occurred; or (b) such entitlement of the refund under subsection 56(7) or 62(3) occurred. (1b) The Director General may make such refund of tax, surcharge, penalty, fee or any other money, as the case may be, after being satisfied that the person has properly established the claim.”. Amendment of section 70"
      }
    },
