      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “free commercial zone” wherever appearing the words “free zone”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “except for goods used” the words “except for goods imported to be used or consumed”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_c__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words “purpose of commercial” the word “, manufacturing”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_c__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting at the end of the paragraph the word “and”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: “(b) no tax shall be charged on any supply of taxable goods made within or between a free zone.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting paragraph (c). New sections 162a and 162b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_61",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "61",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 162 the following sections: “Goods removed from a free zone including goods under lease agreement 162a. (1) Tax shall be due and payable upon all goods removed from a free zone to another free zone through Malaysia or from a free zone to Malaysia including any goods under lease agreement as if the removal were importation into Malaysia. (2) Unless the Minister otherwise directs in an order under section 163, the payment of tax under subsection (1) shall be suspended on any goods removed from a free zone through Malaysia— (a) to another free zone; (b) to a designated area; or (c) to a warehouse under section 70. Supply of goods or services by taxable person whose principal place of business located in a free zone 162b. Tax shall be charged by a taxable person whose principal place of business is located in a free zone on any taxable supply of goods or services made within Malaysia.”. Amendment of section 163"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_62",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "62",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_62__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_62__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 163 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_62__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_62",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the shoulder note the following shoulder note: “Power of Minister to impose tax”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_62__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_62",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, prescribe— (a) any goods imported into, supplied within or between free zone to be chargeable to tax; or (b) any goods removed from a free zone through Malaysia to another free zone, to a designated area or to a warehouse under section 70 to be subject to payment of tax.”. Amendment of Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_63",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "63",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Second Schedule to the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph 7 the following paragraph: “Supply of land in compliance with requirement of written law, Government or local authority 8. (1) Any supply of land by a developer or an owner of the land to the Federal Government, a State Government, a local authority or any other person in compliance with the requirement of any written law, the Federal Government, State Government or local authority for the purposes of providing public amenities and public utilities whether for no consideration or at nominal value shall be treated as neither a supply of goods nor supply of services. (2) For the purposes of subparagraph (1), public amenities and public utilities means the amenities and utilities provided in the layout plan for a project which has been approved by the relevant local authority.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_37",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "37",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_37__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_37__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_37__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 38 comes into operation on the coming into operation of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_37__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 39 comes into operation on 22 October 2016. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_38__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_38__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 2 of the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_38__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “Labuan non-trading activity”, by inserting after the words “any other properties” the words “situated in Labuan”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_38__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “Labuan business activity”, in proviso (b), by substituting for the word “investments” the word “shares”. Amendment of section 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V__cl_39",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "39",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 21 the following section: “Power of Minister to make regulations 21. The Minister may make regulations— (a) generally for the purpose of carrying out, or giving effect to, the provisions of this Act; (b) for the purpose of implementing or facilitating the operation of an arrangement having effect under section 132b of the Income Tax Act 1967 and prescribing penalties for any contravention or failure to comply with any of the provisions of any regulations made under this paragraph.”."
      }
    }
  ]
}
